# F11 milestone review (2026-11-02), after f11q (restore-tabs back on, and a bad line in ofx.conf,
# from run.sh): started on a file in home, it is no plain start: the file selected in the tab shown,
# f11p's kept tabs behind, in their order; and the start's word about ofx.conf's bad line stays.
settle
expect tabs=3 tab=0 tabdirs=tree|tree|sub2 sel=top.txt statusbad=1 not key value line
# (the question: f11p's stand-in, ended, left a line that is a crash's now) forgotten
expect modal=restore
type n
expect modal=-
quit
